5. Fail on drift. Workflow migration is a deployment operation and this test never mutates live configuration.`,
    },
    tag: ['@area:pgr', '@kind:lifecycle', '@layer:api', '@persona:cross', '@deprecated:digit-3.0'] }, async () => {
